    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d940">

                <pb facs="0957" n="845" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg845"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 892.001/9.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister for
                        Foreign Affairs of Siam.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November 4,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to inform Your Royal Highness that the honorable George Cornell
                    Tarler has been designated to attend the coronation of His Majesty the King of
                    Siam as special representative of the President of the United States, and to
                    request that he may be cordially received in such capacity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
